1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,100
Most agents help you do more.

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,000
Fewer helps you do less.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,000
On purpose.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,200
Four asks just hit its inbox:

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,900
an invite, a coffee, a panel,
and a hijack attempt.

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,800
It weighs each one against
my three goals,

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,400
checks who's asking,

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,100
and plain rules decide:

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,800
yes, smaller, ask one question,
or blocked.

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,600
Then it sends me one brief,
with a single-use code.

11
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:29,500
I reply YES and the replies
go out, exactly once.
